OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply situation 'improving'
OL,4,Ain Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water has said improving
OL,7,Fconditions and recent measures have
OL,8,Freduced the immediate likelihood of
OL,9,Ffurther water restrictions in Sussex.
OL,11,FAlthough Sussex remains in severe
OL,12,Fdrought, the company said recent
OL,13,Frainfall, temporary changes to water
OL,14,Fabstraction licences and other measures
OL,15,Fhad improved the situation.
OL,17,FHowever, the water company urged
OL,18,Fcustomers to continue using water
OL,19,Fcarefully while supplies recover.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
