OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply situation 'improving'
OL,4,Ain Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want to reassure people that the
OL,7,Fsituation is improving and the
OL,8,Fimmediate pressure to introduce
OL,9,Fadditional restrictions is reducing,"
OL,10,Fsaid Douglas Whitfield, water supply
OL,11,Fdirector.
